From 8f06cc42ce53ab59dd22b89e47dfd9b0ae296efb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:06:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] oblivios: the findings D1 to D9 of the read of 2026-11-15
 (warm decoy, finger key, stage, wipe PIN, Home key)

Squash of former patches:

- 0050 oblivios: the warm decoy and the lock-time copies run only in the owner's session, and the wait for the decoy's unlock does not spin
- 0051 oblivios: the decoy finger link zeroizes its wrap key and a restore cannot refill the cache after a change of the link
- 0052 oblivios: the switch stage cannot end SystemUI or stay up when its receiver fails, and decodes one wallpaper at a time
- 0053 oblivios: a wipe PIN or password that unlocks the decoy is refused
- 0054 oblivios: the Home key is not held back by a deferred decoy home
---
